(5575009, 807354, 99448, '<td valign="top">OMG, outstanding, love the sunset, and i think there is a little river, great shot, best so far, hope it does well, <b><u>10</u></b> and it''s made <u><b>favorites </b></u></td>', 'OMG, outstanding, love the sunset, and i think there is a little river, great shot, best so far, hope it does well, 10 and it''s made favorites ', '2009-07-15 13:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
