(5575702, 807224, 37845, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible shot. Great texture in the rocks, and the turbulent water really adds nicely. I think this will be top 10.</td>', 'This is an incredible shot. Great texture in the rocks, and the turbulent water really adds nicely. I think this will be top 10.', '2009-07-15 22:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
