(5575717, 807452, 37845, '<td valign="top">Salt pools?<br/> <br/>Very cool shot. I will be checking after the challenge to see where you shot this... I wouldnt mind spending a day or two there myself.</td>', 'Salt pools? Very cool shot. I will be checking after the challenge to see where you shot this... I wouldnt mind spending a day or two there myself.', '2009-07-15 22:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575723, 807164, 37845, '<td valign="top">Cool place to visit :)  Beautifully shot, with great colour. I am always amazed at how unique some rock formations are.</td>', 'Cool place to visit :)  Beautifully shot, with great colour. I am always amazed at how unique some rock formations are.', '2009-07-15 23:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575724, 807190, 37845, '<td valign="top">That does look like a rose :)   Good choice of DOF here as well.</td>', 'That does look like a rose :)   Good choice of DOF here as well.', '2009-07-15 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
