(5575838, 807343, 37845, '<td valign="top">This would have been perfect for the zen challenge a few weeks ago. Very peaceful, and I love the cool colours.</td>', 'This would have been perfect for the zen challenge a few weeks ago. Very peaceful, and I love the cool colours.', '2009-07-16 00:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575840, 807408, 37845, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if anyone would show a geologist :)  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'I was wondering if anyone would show a geologist :)  Nice take on the challenge.', '2009-07-16 00:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575980, 807203, 30712, '<td valign="top">An impressive combination of shape, form and colour.  The balance of the image is perfect, leading the eye right into the rock passage.</td>', 'An impressive combination of shape, form and colour.  The balance of the image is perfect, leading the eye right into the rock passage.', '2009-07-16 02:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575989, 806703, 30712, '<td valign="top">Because of the basic editing requirement more needs to be done to avoid the glare from the sun.  Concentrating on one of the arches might have given you a more interesting image.  Getting a greater angle on the bridge would also give more interest.</td>', 'Because of the basic editing requirement more needs to be done to avoid the glare from the sun.  Concentrating on one of the arches might have given you a more interesting image.  Getting a greater angle on the bridge would also give more interest.', '2009-07-16 02:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575992, 805521, 30712, '<td valign="top">The brickwork is of great interest but I find the blurred background a distraction in this case.  For me the pattern of the brick has enough value in itself.</td>', 'The brickwork is of great interest but I find the blurred background a distraction in this case.  For me the pattern of the brick has enough value in itself.', '2009-07-16 02:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575998, 807445, 30712, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that the lighting was on your side here.  There''s a better picture hiding here I''m sure - another angle maybe, even another time or day.</td>', 'I don''t think that the lighting was on your side here.  There''s a better picture hiding here I''m sure - another angle maybe, even another time or day.', '2009-07-16 02:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576047, 807179, 30712, '<td valign="top">A very satisfying and well balanced image.  Beautiful colours and textures.</td>', 'A very satisfying and well balanced image.  Beautiful colours and textures.', '2009-07-16 02:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576053, 807452, 30712, '<td valign="top">The lighting and muted colours make this image special.  I''m not sure about the positioning of the trees but the rest of the image makes up for this imperfection.</td>', 'The lighting and muted colours make this image special.  I''m not sure about the positioning of the trees but the rest of the image makes up for this imperfection.', '2009-07-16 02:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576480, 806987, 83313, '<td valign="top">My own effort with a similar rock face in another challenge showed me how hard it is to photograph something like this. It''s hard to get the same visual impact as it has when you are in front of it. Not sure what the trick is on these.</td>', 'My own effort with a similar rock face in another challenge showed me how hard it is to photograph something like this. It''s hard to get the same visual impact as it has when you are in front of it. Not sure what the trick is on these.', '2009-07-16 13:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576482, 806147, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is the tree embedded in the cliff face? It looks a little odd. Might just be the perspective caused by the lens.</td>', 'Is the tree embedded in the cliff face? It looks a little odd. Might just be the perspective caused by the lens.', '2009-07-16 13:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576484, 806522, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great b/w tones on those rocks.</td>', 'Great b/w tones on those rocks.', '2009-07-16 13:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576660, 807203, 23921, '<td valign="top">nice, but the light is bit harsh and w/b is off</td>', 'nice, but the light is bit harsh and w/b is off', '2009-07-16 15:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576661, 807304, 23921, '<td valign="top">awesome photo</td>', 'awesome photo', '2009-07-16 15:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576697, 807219, 98132, '<td valign="top">i love the colors!!!!! gorgeous lighting!</td>', 'i love the colors!!!!! gorgeous lighting!', '2009-07-16 16:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576738, 807021, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. Almost too much detail to try and squeeze into 640 pixels.</td>', 'Nice scene. Almost too much detail to try and squeeze into 640 pixels.', '2009-07-16 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576745, 807372, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the point of the coin and jewelery on the rock is. The connection is not even rustling my hair as it goes over my head. The pic is nice and sharp, with a good DOF to separate it from the background.</td>', 'Not sure what the point of the coin and jewelery on the rock is. The connection is not even rustling my hair as it goes over my head. The pic is nice and sharp, with a good DOF to separate it from the background.', '2009-07-16 17:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576748, 807054, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice strong b/w. I''d like to know how you did the adjustments to get this look.</td>', 'Nice strong b/w. I''d like to know how you did the adjustments to get this look.', '2009-07-16 17:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576750, 807179, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of cool looking, though I have no sense of scale.</td>', 'Kind of cool looking, though I have no sense of scale.', '2009-07-16 17:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576754, 807207, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yup, I knew someone would use this challenge for a landscape! Gorgeous scene, and I suppose it does fit. Watch your JPEG compression levels. I see some compression artifacts in the sky near the edges of the mountains, and a 70k file size says you had plenty of overhead to avoid it,</td>', 'Yup, I knew someone would use this challenge for a landscape! Gorgeous scene, and I suppose it does fit. Watch your JPEG compression levels. I see some compression artifacts in the sky near the edges of the mountains, and a 70k file size says you had plenty of overhead to avoid it,', '2009-07-16 17:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576756, 807125, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a good thing photographing these does not wear them out!</td>', 'It''s a good thing photographing these does not wear them out!', '2009-07-16 17:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576757, 807272, 83313, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of the children''s book <a href="//www.amazon.com/Stone-Soup-Aladdin-Picture-Books/dp/0689711034/ref=sr_1_2?ie=UTF8&amp;s=books&amp;qid=1247777387&amp;sr=8-2" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"Stone Soup"</a>.</td>', 'Makes me think of the children''s book "Stone Soup".', '2009-07-16 17:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576792, 807353, 108282, '<td valign="top">Why not have the whole rock in focus? Or focus on some interesting details?</td>', 'Why not have the whole rock in focus? Or focus on some interesting details?', '2009-07-16 19:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
