(5576861, 807041, 98171, '<td valign="top">i am not being mean at all when i say this, but this image hurts my eyes. Its intersting to look at, but I suppose the oversaturation makes it psychedelic.</td>', 'i am not being mean at all when i say this, but this image hurts my eyes. Its intersting to look at, but I suppose the oversaturation makes it psychedelic.', '2009-07-16 20:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576862, 807344, 98171, '<td valign="top">vignetting is waaaay overdone here. I dont think it was necessary at all. Somehow Im thinking this is a rock formation in a swimming pool. In fact, I know it.</td>', 'vignetting is waaaay overdone here. I dont think it was necessary at all. Somehow Im thinking this is a rock formation in a swimming pool. In fact, I know it.', '2009-07-16 20:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576863, 807304, 98171, '<td valign="top">This image is absolutely surreal, its gorgeous, its amazing.</td>', 'This image is absolutely surreal, its gorgeous, its amazing.', '2009-07-16 20:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576867, 807220, 67152, '<td valign="top">a really cool location - a bit over sharpened</td>', 'a really cool location - a bit over sharpened', '2009-07-16 20:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576872, 805880, 67152, '<td valign="top">gorgeous light - it makes the shot</td>', 'gorgeous light - it makes the shot', '2009-07-16 20:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576906, 807343, 46832, '<td valign="top">Great photo but not really geology, is it?  Still a 7.</td>', 'Great photo but not really geology, is it?  Still a 7.', '2009-07-16 20:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577067, 806761, 108650, '<td valign="top">I am enjoying the blue tones to this photo, but with each glance I feel the need for just a little more of the earth and a little less sky.  Overall, nice landscape.</td>', 'I am enjoying the blue tones to this photo, but with each glance I feel the need for just a little more of the earth and a little less sky.  Overall, nice landscape.', '2009-07-16 23:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577069, 807452, 108650, '<td valign="top">Fantastic subjects and colors.  Next time, I would choose just one of the trees to be part of the overall composition as the two really detract from those beautiful amber hues.</td>', 'Fantastic subjects and colors.  Next time, I would choose just one of the trees to be part of the overall composition as the two really detract from those beautiful amber hues.', '2009-07-16 23:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577072, 806695, 108650, '<td valign="top">This is quite interesting.  You should shoot some more to see what clouds or sundown/up could add to he depth of this picture.</td>', 'This is quite interesting.  You should shoot some more to see what clouds or sundown/up could add to he depth of this picture.', '2009-07-16 23:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577074, 806723, 108650, '<td valign="top">Beautiful waterfall and great composition-wise.  The blue in this picture seems a bit off, try adjusting the saturation or desaturating it altogether!</td>', 'Beautiful waterfall and great composition-wise.  The blue in this picture seems a bit off, try adjusting the saturation or desaturating it altogether!', '2009-07-16 23:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577080, 805880, 108650, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I would have tried getting closer to the ground with a slight upwards angle just to exaggerate the streaky clouds bursting over the large rock-mound area.</td>', 'Great idea! I would have tried getting closer to the ground with a slight upwards angle just to exaggerate the streaky clouds bursting over the large rock-mound area.', '2009-07-16 23:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577083, 807353, 108650, '<td valign="top">Excellent execution of the shallow DOF.  Would have cropped this so the stone was more in the upper right corner.</td>', 'Excellent execution of the shallow DOF.  Would have cropped this so the stone was more in the upper right corner.', '2009-07-16 23:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577085, 807354, 108650, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and landscape.  The haziness that washes over that main ridge is a bit detracting though.  Would be better with a clear, crisp feel.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and landscape.  The haziness that washes over that main ridge is a bit detracting though.  Would be better with a clear, crisp feel.', '2009-07-16 23:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577087, 807431, 37845, '<td valign="top">A nice landscape, although this would look a lot better with less size restrictions.</td>', 'A nice landscape, although this would look a lot better with less size restrictions.', '2009-07-16 23:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577088, 806973, 37845, '<td valign="top">Looks like kryptonite... only red :)  never heard of vesicular basalt before.. I should look it up.</td>', 'Looks like kryptonite... only red :)  never heard of vesicular basalt before.. I should look it up.', '2009-07-16 23:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577090, 807416, 108650, '<td valign="top">Quality work, excellent hues, and perfect subject.  I would like to see less sky and a little more of those great rocks.</td>', 'Quality work, excellent hues, and perfect subject.  I would like to see less sky and a little more of those great rocks.', '2009-07-16 23:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577091, 807041, 37845, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit like topaz, or photomatix. When I look at this photo, I mainly look at the pier, which doesnt relate to geology. Only after reading the title to I spend any time looking at the pebbles.</td>', 'This looks a bit like topaz, or photomatix. When I look at this photo, I mainly look at the pier, which doesnt relate to geology. Only after reading the title to I spend any time looking at the pebbles.', '2009-07-16 23:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577092, 807224, 108650, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot.  I feel this would be even better desaturated.</td>', 'Fantastic shot.  I feel this would be even better desaturated.', '2009-07-16 23:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577100, 806522, 108650, '<td valign="top">Great subject! Unfortunately that ship drove right through your picture and the tree branch snuck in.  I know you couldn''t omit them for the challenge, so I''ll just look for a better shot next time!</td>', 'Great subject! Unfortunately that ship drove right through your picture and the tree branch snuck in.  I know you couldn''t omit them for the challenge, so I''ll just look for a better shot next time!', '2009-07-16 23:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577104, 806257, 108650, '<td valign="top">I really do love this photo.  I would definately desaturate to bring out that great ripple!</td>', 'I really do love this photo.  I would definately desaturate to bring out that great ripple!', '2009-07-16 23:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577113, 807304, 108650, '<td valign="top">Obviously, you''ve perfected the coveted flowing water effect.  Unfortunately, some gentle vibrations seem to have run through your camera and your rocks appear to be blurry.  I also feel this could use a little more contrast as the forerocks and crane seem a little too light.</td>', 'Obviously, you''ve perfected the coveted flowing water effect.  Unfortunately, some gentle vibrations seem to have run through your camera and your rocks appear to be blurry.  I also feel this could use a little more contrast as the forerocks and crane seem a little too light.', '2009-07-16 23:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577117, 807219, 108650, '<td valign="top">Stunning vibrant colors! I hope you took many pictures while you visited this fantastic location.  I would prefer to see this photo a little more focused on the lighter region to the right due to its ability to draw the eye in.</td>', 'Stunning vibrant colors! I hope you took many pictures while you visited this fantastic location.  I would prefer to see this photo a little more focused on the lighter region to the right due to its ability to draw the eye in.', '2009-07-16 23:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577123, 807022, 108650, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but a bit hokey.  Try this with a vintage map (minus the grease stains, sorry) and other nostalgic items</td>', 'Good idea, but a bit hokey.  Try this with a vintage map (minus the grease stains, sorry) and other nostalgic items', '2009-07-16 23:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577133, 807059, 108650, '<td valign="top">Great location.  Keep shooting here to capture all the different moods of the sky.  This sky is a bit too ambiguous to be captivating.</td>', 'Great location.  Keep shooting here to capture all the different moods of the sky.  This sky is a bit too ambiguous to be captivating.', '2009-07-17 00:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577151, 806763, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great image, good reflections.  Maybe the rock formation is a little too far to the right and the person in front a slight negative, but a really good image for this challenge.</td>', 'A great image, good reflections.  Maybe the rock formation is a little too far to the right and the person in front a slight negative, but a really good image for this challenge.', '2009-07-17 00:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577153, 807191, 96881, '<td valign="top">The colours, the shapes, the lighting all make this a really interesting photo.  Exceptionally well suited to this challenge.......</td>', 'The colours, the shapes, the lighting all make this a really interesting photo.  Exceptionally well suited to this challenge.......', '2009-07-17 00:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577154, 807228, 96881, '<td valign="top">The colours that you have captured in the rock are great, and the colours of the surrounding rocks compliment the image well.</td>', 'The colours that you have captured in the rock are great, and the colours of the surrounding rocks compliment the image well.', '2009-07-17 00:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577156, 807342, 96881, '<td valign="top">An interesting image in what was probably really tricky lighting conditions.  You have a great depth of colours in the rocks, from the light through reds and browns which make this image.</td>', 'An interesting image in what was probably really tricky lighting conditions.  You have a great depth of colours in the rocks, from the light through reds and browns which make this image.', '2009-07-17 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577157, 805880, 96881, '<td valign="top">A really well composed image of a simple place, that however fits the challenge really well adn shows off the areas beauty.......really well done</td>', 'A really well composed image of a simple place, that however fits the challenge really well adn shows off the areas beauty.......really well done', '2009-07-17 00:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577158, 807380, 96881, '<td valign="top">You have managed to make these rocks stand out well against the nature photographs as the lighting is good and the contrasting colours make for an interesting shot.  A greater depth of field though may have made this even better, as the greens from the far rock could then have also been more of a statement</td>', 'You have managed to make these rocks stand out well against the nature photographs as the lighting is good and the contrasting colours make for an interesting shot.  A greater depth of field though may have made this even better, as the greens from the far rock could then have also been more of a statement', '2009-07-17 00:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577159, 807054, 96881, '<td valign="top">A black and white image that is really well executed and processed.  Well presented as well..........</td>', 'A black and white image that is really well executed and processed.  Well presented as well..........', '2009-07-17 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577160, 807224, 96881, '<td valign="top">The long exposure of the water over rocks has beenr eally well executed here and provides a great image that fits the challenge...........</td>', 'The long exposure of the water over rocks has beenr eally well executed here and provides a great image that fits the challenge...........', '2009-07-17 00:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577162, 806781, 96881, '<td valign="top">The colours through the sky are nice, but the artificial light onto the rocks casts harsh shaddows that does detract from the overall effect here.  Photographing earlier where more ambient light existed may have lost the background colours, but would have avoided those shaddows</td>', 'The colours through the sky are nice, but the artificial light onto the rocks casts harsh shaddows that does detract from the overall effect here.  Photographing earlier where more ambient light existed may have lost the background colours, but would have avoided those shaddows', '2009-07-17 00:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577166, 807164, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nice well composed image.  Use of the Shaddow/Highlight function in PS (or similar in other programs) would have allowed you to lighten the rocks and show more detail there, while darkening the sky and surrounds, giving a richer colour.  Some work on the individual colour channels could then have brought the image out more, while avoiding the fake Green trees..........</td>', 'A nice well composed image.  Use of the Shaddow/Highlight function in PS (or similar in other programs) would have allowed you to lighten the rocks and show more detail there, while darkening the sky and surrounds, giving a richer colour.  Some work on the individual colour channels could then have brought the image out more, while avoiding the fake Green trees..........', '2009-07-17 00:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577167, 807335, 96881, '<td valign="top">Simple, but well executed.  An interesting piece.......</td>', 'Simple, but well executed.  An interesting piece.......', '2009-07-17 00:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577168, 807203, 96881, '<td valign="top">The lines through the rock, curving their way around, the different colous and details, all add to make this a very interesting image.</td>', 'The lines through the rock, curving their way around, the different colous and details, all add to make this a very interesting image.', '2009-07-17 00:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577169, 806878, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great location.  However I feel that it is a little restrained by the crop.  I think a wider view, giving us more at the top of the image, and more to the left, could then have put the waterfall on the third line, and some space above to balance the photo...........</td>', 'A great location.  However I feel that it is a little restrained by the crop.  I think a wider view, giving us more at the top of the image, and more to the left, could then have put the waterfall on the third line, and some space above to balance the photo...........', '2009-07-17 00:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577171, 807219, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great colours.  I am not sure how you captured this, and there is another image I think from a similar location, but the processing of this to get those colours is really good.</td>', 'Great colours.  I am not sure how you captured this, and there is another image I think from a similar location, but the processing of this to get those colours is really good.', '2009-07-17 00:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577172, 807304, 96881, '<td valign="top">The long exposure over the rocks works well, and the bird, in the bottom corner, although small, adds to the image as well, making it about more than just a long exposure..........</td>', 'The long exposure over the rocks works well, and the bird, in the bottom corner, although small, adds to the image as well, making it about more than just a long exposure..........', '2009-07-17 00:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577174, 807059, 96881, '<td valign="top">I struggle to find a subject in this image.  The lack of something to draw the eyes means that they get drawn to the sky, where the colours are not what I would like.  The sky looks washed out, and the hint of blue and red is overwhelmed by the white through the middle.    A tighter crop on that interesting rock out towards the horizon may have worked, and also getting better colours through the image also would have helped</td>', 'I struggle to find a subject in this image.  The lack of something to draw the eyes means that they get drawn to the sky, where the colours are not what I would like.  The sky looks washed out, and the hint of blue and red is overwhelmed by the white through the middle.    A tighter crop on that interesting rock out towards the horizon may have worked, and also getting better colours through the image also would have helped', '2009-07-17 00:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577176, 807431, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great location, the erosion of the cliffs works well here.  However, the Lighthouse seems more like an afterthough, so far to the edge of the image, and even the left is tightly cropped.  You could have gotton away with some more sky.......<br/> <br/>Hope that you have the images to the left and right, as this would make a good panoramic crop...........</td>', 'Great location, the erosion of the cliffs works well here.  However, the Lighthouse seems more like an afterthough, so far to the edge of the image, and even the left is tightly cropped.  You could have gotton away with some more sky....... Hope that you have the images to the left and right, as this would make a good panoramic crop...........', '2009-07-17 00:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577405, 807304, 92577, '<td valign="top">"You told me the only reason he didn''t move was that he was tired and shagged out after a long squawk!" - Monty Pythons Parrot Sketch.<br/> <br/>This has got to go high - it''s great!</td>', '"You told me the only reason he didn''t move was that he was tired and shagged out after a long squawk!" - Monty Pythons Parrot Sketch. This has got to go high - it''s great!', '2009-07-17 10:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577406, 806878, 92577, '<td valign="top">great shot for the challenge - (is that a concrete tunnel the water''s emerging from?)</td>', 'great shot for the challenge - (is that a concrete tunnel the water''s emerging from?)', '2009-07-17 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577407, 807166, 92577, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I know it''s bleak out there but a touch more saturation may have helped to boost it</td>', 'Very nice - I know it''s bleak out there but a touch more saturation may have helped to boost it', '2009-07-17 10:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577411, 807219, 92577, '<td valign="top">processing has left this looking surprisingly flat - nice colors though</td>', 'processing has left this looking surprisingly flat - nice colors though', '2009-07-17 10:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577413, 807220, 92577, '<td valign="top">Interesting location - looks like ''nature''s knurled knob''</td>', 'Interesting location - looks like ''nature''s knurled knob''', '2009-07-17 10:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577414, 807164, 92577, '<td valign="top">Stunning location - I''ve been there but didn''t see this exact view - terrific</td>', 'Stunning location - I''ve been there but didn''t see this exact view - terrific', '2009-07-17 10:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577416, 807054, 98171, '<td valign="top">I normally hate borders, but I think it really helps make this picture even better.</td>', 'I normally hate borders, but I think it really helps make this picture even better.', '2009-07-17 10:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577417, 807408, 98171, '<td valign="top">People are probably drilling you because you took a different perspective on geology. I like it, its unique, and the image is of great quality. -8</td>', 'People are probably drilling you because you took a different perspective on geology. I like it, its unique, and the image is of great quality. -8', '2009-07-17 10:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577438, 806878, 108650, '<td valign="top">Great location.  Would like to see more of the waterfall and great stonescape, but less of the actual pool of water.</td>', 'Great location.  Would like to see more of the waterfall and great stonescape, but less of the actual pool of water.', '2009-07-17 11:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577449, 807203, 37845, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines in this shot.. they carry you through the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful lines in this shot.. they carry you through the photo.', '2009-07-17 11:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577450, 807137, 37845, '<td valign="top">Looks manufactured in a way, as if this is someones back yard waterfall, so it takes away from the geology of the shot. Nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Looks manufactured in a way, as if this is someones back yard waterfall, so it takes away from the geology of the shot. Nice shot nonetheless.', '2009-07-17 11:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577455, 806763, 37845, '<td valign="top">That is a very cool scene. Looks like a giant elephant, or camel, in stone.</td>', 'That is a very cool scene. Looks like a giant elephant, or camel, in stone.', '2009-07-17 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577457, 807354, 37845, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color in this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful color in this shot.', '2009-07-17 11:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577458, 805742, 37845, '<td valign="top">When I saw that this challenge was announced, I knew that some of the top photos would be from the canyons and red rock. Beautiful shot. I like how you didnt over do it with the saturation of colours.</td>', 'When I saw that this challenge was announced, I knew that some of the top photos would be from the canyons and red rock. Beautiful shot. I like how you didnt over do it with the saturation of colours.', '2009-07-17 11:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577460, 807144, 37845, '<td valign="top">I like your take on the challenge.... it is different from all the landscapes. I would like it better had you focused on him, instead of the hat and the rock.</td>', 'I like your take on the challenge.... it is different from all the landscapes. I would like it better had you focused on him, instead of the hat and the rock.', '2009-07-17 11:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577462, 807311, 37845, '<td valign="top">An incredible shot, give a feeling of the giant scale of these mountains.</td>', 'An incredible shot, give a feeling of the giant scale of these mountains.', '2009-07-17 11:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577473, 807154, 106888, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, especially the composition, but the rock in the middle (quartz?) is a little out of focus and perhaps a little washed out.  To sum up, the amount of detail on the subject does not equal the amount of detail that exists around it.  IMHO, I wish it did.  Nice photo.</td>', 'I like this idea, especially the composition, but the rock in the middle (quartz?) is a little out of focus and perhaps a little washed out.  To sum up, the amount of detail on the subject does not equal the amount of detail that exists around it.  IMHO, I wish it did.  Nice photo.', '2009-07-17 12:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577480, 805880, 106888, '<td valign="top">That shade of green you brought out in the grass is perfect!  Nice shot.</td>', 'That shade of green you brought out in the grass is perfect!  Nice shot.', '2009-07-17 12:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577501, 807309, 106888, '<td valign="top">I love that you put the horizon line at the very top of the composition.  Way to be out-of-the-ordinary!</td>', 'I love that you put the horizon line at the very top of the composition.  Way to be out-of-the-ordinary!', '2009-07-17 12:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577509, 807191, 3102, '<td valign="top">I was just wondering whether anyone would have an Antelope Canyon shot for this challenge.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I was just wondering whether anyone would have an Antelope Canyon shot for this challenge.  Nicely done!', '2009-07-17 12:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577588, 807347, 83313, '<td valign="top">DOF seems a touch shallow for the subject, and the shot overall seems a bit dark to me. Interesting subject and good colors and detail on it.</td>', 'DOF seems a touch shallow for the subject, and the shot overall seems a bit dark to me. Interesting subject and good colors and detail on it.', '2009-07-17 14:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577591, 807452, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene. The only nitpick I might have is the way you composed it with the two trees right at the edge of the frame.</td>', 'Wonderful scene. The only nitpick I might have is the way you composed it with the two trees right at the edge of the frame.', '2009-07-17 14:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577592, 806700, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene, though my eye is not really being guided toward anything in particular.</td>', 'An interesting scene, though my eye is not really being guided toward anything in particular.', '2009-07-17 14:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577593, 807219, 83313, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a very popular cave. How does anyone get a decent shot with all the other photographers in the way?</td>', 'This appears to be a very popular cave. How does anyone get a decent shot with all the other photographers in the way?', '2009-07-17 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577597, 807206, 83313, '<td valign="top">Awesome scene, but it struck me as a little soft, so I looked at the file size. Only 80k when you could have used up to 150k. I think the softness I perceive is due to excessive JPEG compression taking away some detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can but still squeeze in under the challenge limit. I expect this will do fairly well in the challenge in spite of the compression. In fact, I will probably be the only one to notice and comment on it.</td>', 'Awesome scene, but it struck me as a little soft, so I looked at the file size. Only 80k when you could have used up to 150k. I think the softness I perceive is due to excessive JPEG compression taking away some detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can but still squeeze in under the challenge limit. I expect this will do fairly well in the challenge in spite of the compression. In fact, I will probably be the only one to notice and comment on it.', '2009-07-17 14:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577598, 806848, 83313, '<td valign="top">Neat textures and colors to this. Not much to grab my interest otherwise, but hey, it''s a rock.</td>', 'Neat textures and colors to this. Not much to grab my interest otherwise, but hey, it''s a rock.', '2009-07-17 14:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577599, 807443, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to decide if this really fits the challenge, or if you just shoehorned in a landscape shot you liked. Although this field may or may not be on an ancient lake bed, it really does not scream geology to me. I do like it, however.</td>', 'I''m trying to decide if this really fits the challenge, or if you just shoehorned in a landscape shot you liked. Although this field may or may not be on an ancient lake bed, it really does not scream geology to me. I do like it, however.', '2009-07-17 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577601, 807022, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing geology implied here. When I look at this, I see "exploration". It is well done, however. I like the warm sunset lighting.</td>', 'I''m not seeing geology implied here. When I look at this, I see "exploration". It is well done, however. I like the warm sunset lighting.', '2009-07-17 14:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577603, 807041, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, I''ll at least count the pebbles part of it as geology!</td>', 'Well, I''ll at least count the pebbles part of it as geology!', '2009-07-17 14:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577765, 807191, 101492, '<td valign="top">Way to create a sense of actin in a difficult challenge.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'Way to create a sense of actin in a difficult challenge.  Beautiful image.', '2009-07-17 17:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577766, 807203, 101492, '<td valign="top">Great shape, eye movement, color, and lighting.  What a fantastic image.</td>', 'Great shape, eye movement, color, and lighting.  What a fantastic image.', '2009-07-17 17:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577775, 806804, 101492, '<td valign="top">I love the texture in this and the lighting accents it perfectly.</td>', 'I love the texture in this and the lighting accents it perfectly.', '2009-07-17 17:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577777, 807228, 101492, '<td valign="top">The greeen of the geode just pops in this and I really like the contrast of th vivid color against the neutrals in the background.</td>', 'The greeen of the geode just pops in this and I really like the contrast of th vivid color against the neutrals in the background.', '2009-07-17 17:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577783, 807345, 101492, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what you were trying to portray here, but it ended up looking like you accidentally uploaded an outtake.  Is it water over rocks?  Sorry, there needs to be something identifiable, a little more focus or a crisp point of focus would have helped.</td>', 'I am not sure what you were trying to portray here, but it ended up looking like you accidentally uploaded an outtake.  Is it water over rocks?  Sorry, there needs to be something identifiable, a little more focus or a crisp point of focus would have helped.', '2009-07-17 17:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577793, 806703, 101492, '<td valign="top">Too much glare and does not meet challenge</td>', 'Too much glare and does not meet challenge', '2009-07-17 17:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577794, 806977, 101492, '<td valign="top">This looks like an interesting formation but the harsh lighting just kills the image.  It is difficult to photograph in the dark--I assume this is a cave?</td>', 'This looks like an interesting formation but the harsh lighting just kills the image.  It is difficult to photograph in the dark--I assume this is a cave?', '2009-07-17 17:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577842, 807190, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good use of light, nice texture.</td>', 'Good use of light, nice texture.', '2009-07-17 18:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577843, 806804, 19831, '<td valign="top">nice choice of subject, cool shot.</td>', 'nice choice of subject, cool shot.', '2009-07-17 18:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577847, 807408, 19831, '<td valign="top">A nice creative approach to the challenge. I like it, well done.</td>', 'A nice creative approach to the challenge. I like it, well done.', '2009-07-17 18:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577851, 807353, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting to bring out the textue. Nice detail. Good shot.</td>', 'Great use of lighting to bring out the textue. Nice detail. Good shot.', '2009-07-17 18:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577855, 806763, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers! That''s pretty cool. Nice job on the exposure, and well composed, I like the reflections. Nice shot!</td>', 'Wowsers! That''s pretty cool. Nice job on the exposure, and well composed, I like the reflections. Nice shot!', '2009-07-17 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577891, 807445, 37845, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The left side of he shot, being out of focus and dark, dont add much to the shot IMO.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The left side of he shot, being out of focus and dark, dont add much to the shot IMO.', '2009-07-17 18:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577892, 807319, 37845, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mountain range.</td>', 'Beautiful mountain range.', '2009-07-17 18:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577893, 807407, 37845, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cool place to photograph. I think this should could be improved if composed with the horizon visible as well.</td>', 'Looks like a cool place to photograph. I think this should could be improved if composed with the horizon visible as well.', '2009-07-17 18:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577900, 807272, 37845, '<td valign="top">Ive come back to this photo a few times now, and find it difficult to rate and comment on. While the rocks/stones are definitely geology, my own perceptions of geology would suggest something much larger, like a cliffside, or mountain range. So, in the end, I will only leave a comment.</td>', 'Ive come back to this photo a few times now, and find it difficult to rate and comment on. While the rocks/stones are definitely geology, my own perceptions of geology would suggest something much larger, like a cliffside, or mountain range. So, in the end, I will only leave a comment.', '2009-07-17 19:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577901, 807356, 37845, '<td valign="top">A non-traditional shot, and interesting take on the challenge. At first, I didnt like how dark the hand was, but then considering that you are 1Km underground, it seems much more accurate.</td>', 'A non-traditional shot, and interesting take on the challenge. At first, I didnt like how dark the hand was, but then considering that you are 1Km underground, it seems much more accurate.', '2009-07-17 19:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577903, 807343, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a very serene and beautiful image. It''s almost abstract in it''s soft lines and textures and shapes. The focal point of htat iceberg with it''s inverted comma shape is just perfect. Magical.</td>', 'What a very serene and beautiful image. It''s almost abstract in it''s soft lines and textures and shapes. The focal point of htat iceberg with it''s inverted comma shape is just perfect. Magical.', '2009-07-17 19:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577904, 807220, 37845, '<td valign="top">Interesting rock formation. I like that the trees look to be completely taking over.</td>', 'Interesting rock formation. I like that the trees look to be completely taking over.', '2009-07-17 19:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577905, 806763, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, it doeslook like an ancient creature. Like a rhino or elephant or mammoth or combination of all! A stunning scene, nicely captured.</td>', 'Wow, it doeslook like an ancient creature. Like a rhino or elephant or mammoth or combination of all! A stunning scene, nicely captured.', '2009-07-17 19:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577906, 807372, 37845, '<td valign="top">Cute title!    Not sure about the coin and ring on the stone though.</td>', 'Cute title!    Not sure about the coin and ring on the stone though.', '2009-07-17 19:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577907, 807022, 37845, '<td valign="top">Geology or cartography?!?! :)  Interesting and unique take on the challenge.</td>', 'Geology or cartography?!?! :)  Interesting and unique take on the challenge.', '2009-07-17 19:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577932, 807353, 106888, '<td valign="top">I love the way the warm browns of the rock contrast to the neutral gray background... really makes it pop.</td>', 'I love the way the warm browns of the rock contrast to the neutral gray background... really makes it pop.', '2009-07-17 19:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577937, 807164, 106888, '<td valign="top">I love the blue tones of the mountains in the background against the green in the foreground with the neutral gray of the subject between... I think this is a superb image.</td>', 'I love the blue tones of the mountains in the background against the green in the foreground with the neutral gray of the subject between... I think this is a superb image.', '2009-07-17 19:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577943, 807219, 106888, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and composition of this... these shots are usually angled horizontally or downward instead of up.  However, I think the orange is a little oversaturated, especially on the left side--my eye was drawn here first instead of to the upper right where I would have wanted it to go.  Nice image.</td>', 'I like the angle and composition of this... these shots are usually angled horizontally or downward instead of up.  However, I think the orange is a little oversaturated, especially on the left side--my eye was drawn here first instead of to the upper right where I would have wanted it to go.  Nice image.', '2009-07-17 19:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578609, 805574, 92403, '<td valign="top">Like the angle!</td>', 'Like the angle!', '2009-07-18 18:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578610, 807219, 92403, '<td valign="top">Looks like fire!</td>', 'Looks like fire!', '2009-07-18 19:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
