(5580037, 807154, 96881, '<td valign="top">The poor focus of this image means that the textures of the rocks are not clear.  As a result, it becomes just large areas of slightly out of focus colours.  The compositon lacks imagination or something to make it stand out</td>', 'The poor focus of this image means that the textures of the rocks are not clear.  As a result, it becomes just large areas of slightly out of focus colours.  The compositon lacks imagination or something to make it stand out', '2009-07-20 03:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580040, 806977, 96881, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting relecting off the top of the image, and casting harsh shaddows detracts.  I also am struggling to really see what you want me to see, some rock waves but not a real lot to jump out and capture the eye.  The title does not give any ideas either.  Also, the shades of the browns really are not inspiring.</td>', 'The harsh lighting relecting off the top of the image, and casting harsh shaddows detracts.  I also am struggling to really see what you want me to see, some rock waves but not a real lot to jump out and capture the eye.  The title does not give any ideas either.  Also, the shades of the browns really are not inspiring.', '2009-07-20 03:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580041, 807449, 96881, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, due to the presentation, focus and composition of the photo, what appears to be a realy interesting rock with plenty of great colours comes across as a random mix of colour, with no real focal point to draw attention</td>', 'Unfortunately, due to the presentation, focus and composition of the photo, what appears to be a realy interesting rock with plenty of great colours comes across as a random mix of colour, with no real focal point to draw attention', '2009-07-20 03:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580042, 806703, 96881, '<td valign="top">The overall darkness of the image does not appeal, nor dopes the bright sky.  The light conditions make it hard to expose correctly to show the detail.  Also, for me, a bridge does not really meet the Geology challenge</td>', 'The overall darkness of the image does not appeal, nor dopes the bright sky.  The light conditions make it hard to expose correctly to show the detail.  Also, for me, a bridge does not really meet the Geology challenge', '2009-07-20 04:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580043, 807359, 96881, '<td valign="top">Shooting from directly above, with the light behind, for me does not show off the rocks in the most interesting way.  Shooting so that we can see the different shapes, and the light resulting in different shades would have worked better.  The placement of the rocks also does not seem to really appeal</td>', 'Shooting from directly above, with the light behind, for me does not show off the rocks in the most interesting way.  Shooting so that we can see the different shapes, and the light resulting in different shades would have worked better.  The placement of the rocks also does not seem to really appeal', '2009-07-20 04:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580044, 807445, 96881, '<td valign="top">A greater depth of field would have helped here.  At the moment, half of the image is dark and out of focus, whereas with a great depth of field, the details along the rocks to the water could then have made for an interesting shot.</td>', 'A greater depth of field would have helped here.  At the moment, half of the image is dark and out of focus, whereas with a great depth of field, the details along the rocks to the water could then have made for an interesting shot.', '2009-07-20 04:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580045, 807365, 96881, '<td valign="top">I find rocks, especailly quartz, hard to photograph, as it is difficult to capture the subtle colour differences, the edges and shapes, well on camera.  A great er depth of field to ensure all of the rock is sharp in focus was required, as these photos need to be exceptionally sharp to work.  Teh white border detracts for me, and the crop is too close all around the rock.  The lighting also is very difficult, with the right side too dark to show off the detail there</td>', 'I find rocks, especailly quartz, hard to photograph, as it is difficult to capture the subtle colour differences, the edges and shapes, well on camera.  A great er depth of field to ensure all of the rock is sharp in focus was required, as these photos need to be exceptionally sharp to work.  Teh white border detracts for me, and the crop is too close all around the rock.  The lighting also is very difficult, with the right side too dark to show off the detail there', '2009-07-20 04:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580132, 806633, 108611, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful picture. You can trully imagine being there following the waters path as it skims the rocks. Imagining the sounds and smell of the water. Well done. Lovely.</td>', 'this is a beautiful picture. You can trully imagine being there following the waters path as it skims the rocks. Imagining the sounds and smell of the water. Well done. Lovely.', '2009-07-20 06:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
