(5580900, 807272, 96881, '<td valign="top">An interesting image you have composed here.  The colours are very subtle which work really well.  I do feel though that the right side of the photo needed more light, as this is where the main subjects are, and yet much of them is dark and the details hard to see.  Some light coming from that side to brighten them up would have helped.</td>', 'An interesting image you have composed here.  The colours are very subtle which work really well.  I do feel though that the right side of the photo needed more light, as this is where the main subjects are, and yet much of them is dark and the details hard to see.  Some light coming from that side to brighten them up would have helped.', '2009-07-20 20:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580901, 807356, 96881, '<td valign="top">The overall darkness of this photo means it is very hard to see any of the details, and this affects the score.</td>', 'The overall darkness of this photo means it is very hard to see any of the details, and this affects the score.', '2009-07-20 20:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580903, 807408, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different, while everyone else went rocks, you have gone more for the Geloogist.  An interesting image and use of black negative space, which I feel has been effective.  Not sure about the black shirt though that gives the imression that he does not have a body.  Another dark colour, like the jeans, where we see its there but doesn''t take away from the glove and hammer could have worked.</td>', 'Different, while everyone else went rocks, you have gone more for the Geloogist.  An interesting image and use of black negative space, which I feel has been effective.  Not sure about the black shirt though that gives the imression that he does not have a body.  Another dark colour, like the jeans, where we see its there but doesn''t take away from the glove and hammer could have worked.', '2009-07-20 20:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580907, 807021, 96881, '<td valign="top">I find the rocks here a little too bright and the detail washed out, which means they do not stand out strongly as the true subject.  The view does lack a subject to draw attention, as nothing clearly stands out from the rest of the image.</td>', 'I find the rocks here a little too bright and the detail washed out, which means they do not stand out strongly as the true subject.  The view does lack a subject to draw attention, as nothing clearly stands out from the rest of the image.', '2009-07-20 20:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580908, 806909, 96881, '<td valign="top">An interesting piece, however, the overall composition and crop you ahve chosen does not really appeal</td>', 'An interesting piece, however, the overall composition and crop you ahve chosen does not really appeal', '2009-07-20 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5580910, 807360, 96881, '<td valign="top">I find that the person is the subject of this image, and not anything Geology related.  By the composition and processing, the rocks are hard to see any detail, and are really just a convienient background for the person in the shot.</td>', 'I find that the person is the subject of this image, and not anything Geology related.  By the composition and processing, the rocks are hard to see any detail, and are really just a convienient background for the person in the shot.', '2009-07-20 20:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581190, 807299, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the deep, rich colour of the sky.  However, the rocks seem to fade into each other, while you have some great colours there that could have eben worked with.  Some adjustments to individual colour layers could have brought out the reds and greets from the grey rock, and made a more appealing image</td>', 'I like the deep, rich colour of the sky.  However, the rocks seem to fade into each other, while you have some great colours there that could have eben worked with.  Some adjustments to individual colour layers could have brought out the reds and greets from the grey rock, and made a more appealing image', '2009-07-20 23:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581196, 807240, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great collection of stones, and well lit, as you have managed to avoid the bright overpowering reflections that most people get when photographing these angular pieces of rocks......</td>', 'A great collection of stones, and well lit, as you have managed to avoid the bright overpowering reflections that most people get when photographing these angular pieces of rocks......', '2009-07-20 23:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581201, 807041, 96881, '<td valign="top">A different but well thought of image for the challenge, that has also been well executed.  I probably would have cropped the upper inch, which just has the wood beam, and left the next wood beam and the pillars to naturally frame the image, thereby avoiding the large brown area at the top of the image.</td>', 'A different but well thought of image for the challenge, that has also been well executed.  I probably would have cropped the upper inch, which just has the wood beam, and left the next wood beam and the pillars to naturally frame the image, thereby avoiding the large brown area at the top of the image.', '2009-07-21 00:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581205, 807197, 96881, '<td valign="top">An interesting spot to photograph, and one that works well for the challenge.  Some different lighting to give a more dramatic feel could have really made this image one of the best.  The current bright patch at the bottom right for me is a distraction from the overall photo</td>', 'An interesting spot to photograph, and one that works well for the challenge.  Some different lighting to give a more dramatic feel could have really made this image one of the best.  The current bright patch at the bottom right for me is a distraction from the overall photo', '2009-07-21 00:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581208, 807318, 96881, '<td valign="top">A really interesting rock.  I think you might have cropped this a little too tight, as the surrounding water and greenery would have beenr eally good to frame and balance the photo.  Furthermore, having additional space to the right, with the flowing water, I feel would have added both extra interest, and ofset the rock well.</td>', 'A really interesting rock.  I think you might have cropped this a little too tight, as the surrounding water and greenery would have beenr eally good to frame and balance the photo.  Furthermore, having additional space to the right, with the flowing water, I feel would have added both extra interest, and ofset the rock well.', '2009-07-21 00:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581211, 807179, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes and paths through this image.  However, the overall grey feel does not do it justice.  Some extra Post Processing could have brought out the red of the flowers, and the different colours int he rocks, which would then have made this a brilliant shot.</td>', 'I like the shapes and paths through this image.  However, the overall grey feel does not do it justice.  Some extra Post Processing could have brought out the red of the flowers, and the different colours int he rocks, which would then have made this a brilliant shot.', '2009-07-21 00:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581310, 805742, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great location for the challenge.  I do not know whether it is that the image horizon is not straight, or due to the heavy subject loading on one side, but it feels like the image needs to be rotated....Maybe an illusion, but it feels down at the right.<br/>Also, some additional Post Processing I feel could have got more out of this image.  Ie use of the Shaddows/Highlight function in PS (or similar) would have allowed more detail to be retained in the upper area of the rocks (white area) a richer red for the rest of the rocks, a richer green as well in the vegetation and therefore produce a really striking image.</td>', 'A great location for the challenge.  I do not know whether it is that the image horizon is not straight, or due to the heavy subject loading on one side, but it feels like the image needs to be rotated....Maybe an illusion, but it feels down at the right.Also, some additional Post Processing I feel could have got more out of this image.  Ie use of the Shaddows/Highlight function in PS (or similar) would have allowed more detail to be retained in the upper area of the rocks (white area) a richer red for the rest of the rocks, a richer green as well in the vegetation and therefore produce a really striking image.', '2009-07-21 02:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581312, 807416, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nice long exposure image, however the horrizon crossing at the centre of the image doesn''t work for me.................</td>', 'A nice long exposure image, however the horrizon crossing at the centre of the image doesn''t work for me.................', '2009-07-21 02:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581313, 806987, 96881, '<td valign="top">Plenty of years there, however the overall image just seems to lack a subject or focal point, and the colours are not strong enough to carry the image like it is..........</td>', 'Plenty of years there, however the overall image just seems to lack a subject or focal point, and the colours are not strong enough to carry the image like it is..........', '2009-07-21 02:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581314, 806804, 96881, '<td valign="top">A simple image of a very interesting location.  In this case, the shaddows and light make the image......</td>', 'A simple image of a very interesting location.  In this case, the shaddows and light make the image......', '2009-07-21 02:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581317, 806721, 96881, '<td valign="top">Thats true.  I like how you hqave made a simple bend int eh river interesting.  The blue of the water and the red of the bank are really good.  I don''ty know how wide the river is at this point, as I do wish I could see the rest of the bend in the shot, rather than it being cropped off.</td>', 'Thats true.  I like how you hqave made a simple bend int eh river interesting.  The blue of the water and the red of the bank are really good.  I don''ty know how wide the river is at this point, as I do wish I could see the rest of the bend in the shot, rather than it being cropped off.', '2009-07-21 02:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
