(5582148, 807342, 15407, '<td valign="top">This GREAT photo immediately reminded me of the cave depicited in the Peter McGARR MYSTERY:"The Death Of An Irish Sea Wolf". The cave is on Clare Island, in Clew Bay, County Mayo, Ireland. Did you purchance explore "Inside Mother?</td>', 'This GREAT photo immediately reminded me of the cave depicited in the Peter McGARR MYSTERY:"The Death Of An Irish Sea Wolf". The cave is on Clare Island, in Clew Bay, County Mayo, Ireland. Did you purchance explore "Inside Mother?', '2009-07-21 23:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582204, 807346, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the colour you have acheived with the sky in this shot.  The midday sun though causes quite harsh shaddows and flat lighting, which does not help the overall image.......Also, the crop on the right seems a little awkward.</td>', 'I like the colour you have acheived with the sky in this shot.  The midday sun though causes quite harsh shaddows and flat lighting, which does not help the overall image.......Also, the crop on the right seems a little awkward.', '2009-07-22 00:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582208, 806522, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure tat Black and white works best for this, would have been interested to see a colour version.    The blues and browns then could have contrasted well against each other</td>', 'Not sure tat Black and white works best for this, would have been interested to see a colour version.    The blues and browns then could have contrasted well against each other', '2009-07-22 00:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582210, 806257, 96881, '<td valign="top">The colours in this shot are really good.  A slightly wider shot though, giving more sky and more surrounding area left and right I think could have added to this shot.  it would have avoided the cropping of the top of the hill, and the additional sky would have balanced the shot better</td>', 'The colours in this shot are really good.  A slightly wider shot though, giving more sky and more surrounding area left and right I think could have added to this shot.  it would have avoided the cropping of the top of the hill, and the additional sky would have balanced the shot better', '2009-07-22 00:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582213, 806887, 96881, '<td valign="top">Really like the long exposure and the effect you get with the water........Maybe a little more to the right where the cliff is could have added a little as well, as it seems to be an afterthought at the moment</td>', 'Really like the long exposure and the effect you get with the water........Maybe a little more to the right where the cliff is could have added a little as well, as it seems to be an afterthought at the moment', '2009-07-22 00:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
