(5582222, 806700, 96881, '<td valign="top">The overall crop of this makes me feel I am missing much of the view, only able to see a snippet of the scene, and therefore gives an unfinished feel to the shot</td>', 'The overall crop of this makes me feel I am missing much of the view, only able to see a snippet of the scene, and therefore gives an unfinished feel to the shot', '2009-07-22 00:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
