(5582236, 807407, 96881, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot.  Plenty of leading lines here though that just take the eyes to the top of the image.  All of the shot goes towards the one spot up the top, so more space there for the eyes to go and still be on the photo would have helped.</td>', 'An interesting shot.  Plenty of leading lines here though that just take the eyes to the top of the image.  All of the shot goes towards the one spot up the top, so more space there for the eyes to go and still be on the photo would have helped.', '2009-07-22 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582240, 807137, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great long exposure of the waterfall.  however a little more room at the top of the image I think would ahve balanced it better (just showing the green trees) as the top of the water fall i feel is too close to the tiop of the image at the moment</td>', 'A great long exposure of the waterfall.  however a little more room at the top of the image I think would ahve balanced it better (just showing the green trees) as the top of the water fall i feel is too close to the tiop of the image at the moment', '2009-07-22 00:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582244, 806695, 96881, '<td valign="top">A really interesting use of negative space and the natural curves of the land that all lead to the lighthouse.  Really well presented here.</td>', 'A really interesting use of negative space and the natural curves of the land that all lead to the lighthouse.  Really well presented here.', '2009-07-22 00:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582246, 807166, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice photo compositon.  however with the grey sky, I think some additional Post processing could have been done to bring out the features of the overall photo, more depth in the clouds, more vibrance in the greens and browns.  This then would ahve added significantly to the overall effect of the image</td>', 'Nice photo compositon.  however with the grey sky, I think some additional Post processing could have been done to bring out the features of the overall photo, more depth in the clouds, more vibrance in the greens and browns.  This then would ahve added significantly to the overall effect of the image', '2009-07-22 00:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582249, 807190, 96881, '<td valign="top">A very interesting and different shot.  The shallow epth of field is good to remove the background, but I feel you have gone too shallow, as areas of the rose are also OOF as well......</td>', 'A very interesting and different shot.  The shallow epth of field is good to remove the background, but I feel you have gone too shallow, as areas of the rose are also OOF as well......', '2009-07-22 00:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582250, 806723, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nice long exposure, but the large dark areas of the cliffs do not have the depth of colour and detail to make them a feature.</td>', 'A nice long exposure, but the large dark areas of the cliffs do not have the depth of colour and detail to make them a feature.', '2009-07-22 00:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582251, 806761, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed image.......The rocks though seem to have lost the detail though that really could have been a feature of this photo</td>', 'A nicely composed image.......The rocks though seem to have lost the detail though that really could have been a feature of this photo', '2009-07-22 00:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582253, 806716, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you have the photographer in this image, as I don''t feel they really add to the shot.  The overall image crop though doesn''t work.  Some extra sky could have helped balance the overall shot</td>', 'Not sure why you have the photographer in this image, as I don''t feel they really add to the shot.  The overall image crop though doesn''t work.  Some extra sky could have helped balance the overall shot', '2009-07-22 00:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
