(5582292, 806705, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not really sure of the motivation behind this photo.  Are you trying to show the damage of man on the earth??  The ground in the upper left and right corners is not attractive.  With a title to reflect it, you could have made a political statement and made it even more dramatic with a slight angle change and crop change</td>', 'Not really sure of the motivation behind this photo.  Are you trying to show the damage of man on the earth??  The ground in the upper left and right corners is not attractive.  With a title to reflect it, you could have made a political statement and made it even more dramatic with a slight angle change and crop change', '2009-07-22 00:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5582294, 807309, 96881, '<td valign="top">I think a greater depth of field would have worked better here.  Keeping the point in focus would have added to the photo, rather than the slightly OOF area it currently is.</td>', 'I think a greater depth of field would have worked better here.  Keeping the point in focus would have added to the photo, rather than the slightly OOF area it currently is.', '2009-07-22 00:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
