(5583249, 807179, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Kind of cool looking, though I have no sense of scale. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No need for scale, I say.  I''ve seen the same structures at both tens of centimetres, and tens of kilometres.<br/> <br/>A lovely fold, and beautifully accentuated by lichen and mosses.  Well seen!<br/> <br/>This is geology to the geologist.  A top-notch entry, unseen by a bunch of photographers. :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Kind of cool looking, though I have no sense of scale.  No need for scale, I say.  I''ve seen the same structures at both tens of centimetres, and tens of kilometres. A lovely fold, and beautifully accentuated by lichen and mosses.  Well seen! This is geology to the geologist.  A top-notch entry, unseen by a bunch of photographers. :-)', '2009-07-22 13:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
