(5583419, 807191, 86322, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, it is shuch a shame it got disqualified, still a winner nevertheless. Like you commented on my photo, apparently we were at the same place at the same time...I had tons of photos of the upper canyon but didnt want to use them, and used one of the lower instead. Good work.</td>', 'This is a great shot, it is shuch a shame it got disqualified, still a winner nevertheless. Like you commented on my photo, apparently we were at the same place at the same time...I had tons of photos of the upper canyon but didnt want to use them, and used one of the lower instead. Good work.', '2009-07-22 17:14:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5583427, 806147, 35357, '<td valign="top">No appreciable folds to see in this outrop, though definitely tilted.  This is the type of shot a geologist would take while mapping (with hammer for scale), and is a great fit for the challenge, IMO.  Did you remember to record the strike and dip? ;-)</td>', 'No appreciable folds to see in this outrop, though definitely tilted.  This is the type of shot a geologist would take while mapping (with hammer for scale), and is a great fit for the challenge, IMO.  Did you remember to record the strike and dip? ;-)', '2009-07-22 17:23:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5583466, 806257, 106734, '<td valign="top">Great color . . . and the puddle looks more like an oil seep or tar pit of some sort to me. . . The deep blue cast isn''t a reflection of the sky but rather looks like the color of material which looks thick.  Seems to be bubbling from within.  Would like to hear just what this is.</td>', 'Great color . . . and the puddle looks more like an oil seep or tar pit of some sort to me. . . The deep blue cast isn''t a reflection of the sky but rather looks like the color of material which looks thick.  Seems to be bubbling from within.  Would like to hear just what this is.', '2009-07-22 18:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
