(5586936, 807137, 76430, '<td valign="top">Late congrats on the late ribbon!  Beautifully shot, and very fitting title. Maybe panned a little to the left would be good IMHO because of the water going into the shot rather than out of it and from the little we can see the rocks may look better than the grass.  On the other hand maybe there were other structures on the left..</td>', 'Late congrats on the late ribbon!  Beautifully shot, and very fitting title. Maybe panned a little to the left would be good IMHO because of the water going into the shot rather than out of it and from the little we can see the rocks may look better than the grass.  On the other hand maybe there were other structures on the left..', '2009-07-26 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 0),
